{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p000189","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p000189"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p000189","label":"毛叔鄭","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"毛叔鄭","mention_ids":["c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0088"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0088","chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p017","quote":"毛叔鄭"}],"identity_note":"依《周本紀》特定敘事建立；稱號與未見本名不補造，不按同名全庫合併。","review":"ai_provisional"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0088","start":88,"end":91,"surface":"毛叔鄭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000189","status":"source_identified","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p017","chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p017","text":"其明日，除道，修社及商紂宮。及期，百夫荷罕旗以先驅。武王弟叔振鐸奉陳常車，周公旦把大鉞，畢公把小鉞，以夾武王。散宜生、太顛、閎夭皆執劍以衛武王。既入，立于社南大卒之左，右畢從。毛叔鄭奉明水，衛康叔封布茲，召公奭贊采，師尚父牽牲。尹佚筴祝曰：「殷之末孫季紂，殄廢先王明德，侮蔑神祇不祀，昏暴商邑百姓，其章顯聞于天皇上帝。」於是武王再拜稽首，曰：「膺更大命，革殷，受天明命。」武王又再拜稽首，乃出。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"商紂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000136","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000150","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"叔振鐸","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000188","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0037","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"周公旦","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000156","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m017-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"畢公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000185","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zho